{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Through The Pain</i> \u2014 a chaotic, funny, and unexpectedly challenging adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a meme-powered spinning cat on a mission to cross a vast low-poly world full of surprises, traps, and absurd fun. Jump, climb, spin, and laugh (or scream) your way through diverse biomes \u2014 from icy mountains and scorching deserts to western canyons and peaceful forests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey isn\u2019t easy \u2014 inspired by games like <i>Only Up!</i> and <i>A Difficult Game About Climbing</i>, every mistake can send you right back to the start.<br>But every failure makes the victory even sweeter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every obstacle is made to make you smile, rage, and whisper: \u201cokay\u2026 just one more try.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your final goal? Reach the last stage \u2014 a disco table party where the cat\u2019s friends are waiting to celebrate your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One level. Endless chaos. Absolute spin.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073340?t=1762167559","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073340?t=1762167559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/29810e92d67a8d2d2002c9b686b9a4cc93b51beb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762167559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/29810e92d67a8d2d2002c9b686b9a4cc93b51beb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762167559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Through The Pain</i> \u2014 a chaotic, funny, and unexpectedly challenging 